= 1.72"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":68.68,"default_fair_val":68.68,"premium_pct":-36.4,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":14.2,"pe_forward":12.5,"pb_trailing":5,"pb_forward":4.5,"div_yield":1.82,"ps_ratio":2.2,"fcf_to_ev":8.78,"fcf_to_mcap":11.38,"liab_to_assets":105.9,"cash_to_assets":14.5,"current_ratio":1.72,"roe":18,"roa":17.5,"moat":{"ticker":"MTCH","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Match Group 旗下擁有多個知名約會應用程式品牌，如 Tinder、Hinge 和 OkCupid，這些品牌在目標客群中建立了強大的認知度和情感連結。這種品牌忠誠度賦予了公司一定的定價權，尤其是在 Tinder 等旗艦產品上，能夠透過高級訂閱和虛擬商品獲取穩定的營收。然而，品牌之間的競爭激烈，且用戶口味變化快速，使得品牌資產的持續維護和創新成為關鍵。相較於必需品，約會服務的品牌忠誠度仍有其極限，因此定價權並非絕對。","comment_en":"Match Group owns several well-known dating app brands like Tinder, Hinge, and OkCupid, which have established strong brand recognition and emotional connections among their target demographics. This brand loyalty grants the company a degree of pricing power, particularly on flagship products like Tinder, enabling stable revenue generation through premium subscriptions and virtual goods. However, competition among brands is fierce, and user preferences change rapidly, making continuous brand maintenance and innovation crucial. Compared to necessities, brand loyalty in dating services still has its limits, thus pricing power is not absolute."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"約會應用程式行業的進入壁壘相對較低，主要依賴於軟體開發和使用者體驗，而非專利或嚴格的監管許可。Match Group 的核心競爭力在於其平台運營和用戶數據的運用，而非受專利保護的獨特技術。雖然公司可能擁有某些與演算法或功能相關的專利，但這些專利對其整體商業模式的保護作用有限，且容易被模仿或規避。監管方面，雖然存在數據隱私和內容審核等議題，但並未形成顯著的特許經營壁壘。","comment_en":"The dating app industry has relatively low barriers to entry, primarily relying on software development and user experience rather than patents or strict regulatory licenses. Match Group's core competency lies in its platform operations and utilization of user data, not in patent-protected unique technologies. While the company may hold some patents related to algorithms or features, their protective effect on its overall business model is limited and easily imitated or circumvented. In terms of regulation, although issues like data privacy and content moderation exist, they do not form significant proprietary barriers."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"用戶在約會應用程式之間的轉換成本相對較低，主要體現在重新建立個人資料和社交連結的時間成本。然而，一旦用戶在特定平台上建立了穩定的社交網絡、累積了使用習慣或付費訂閱，轉換的意願就會降低。Match Group 透過其龐大的用戶基礎和多樣化的產品組合，能夠在一定程度上鎖定用戶。但與金融服務或企業軟體相比，用戶轉換的阻力仍屬中等，並非極高的黏性。","comment_en":"The cost for users to switch between dating apps is relatively low, mainly involving the time cost of rebuilding profiles and social connections. However, once users establish a stable social network, accumulate usage habits, or have paid for subscriptions on a specific platform, their willingness to switch decreases. Match Group, with its vast user base and diverse product portfolio, can lock in users to some extent. However, compared to financial services or enterprise software, the resistance to user switching remains moderate, not extremely high stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Match Group 的核心優勢在於強大的網絡效應。隨著越來越多的用戶加入 Tinder、Hinge 等平台，其對新用戶的吸引力也隨之增加，因為用戶希望與更多潛在的匹配對象互動。這種正向循環效應使得領先平台的用戶基礎不斷擴大，對後來者構成了顯著的進入障礙。網絡效應在約會應用程式領域尤為重要，因為平台的價值直接與用戶數量和活躍度掛鉤，形成了難以撼動的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"Match Group's core strength lies in its powerful network effects. As more users join platforms like Tinder and Hinge, their attractiveness to new users increases because users want to interact with more potential matches. This positive feedback loop leads to a continuously expanding user base for leading platforms, creating a significant barrier to entry for newcomers. Network effects are particularly crucial in the dating app sector, as the platform's value is directly tied to user numbers and activity, forming an unshakeable competitive advantage."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為全球最大的約會應用程式公司，Match Group 在規模經濟方面具有顯著優勢。龐大的用戶基礎使其能夠攤薄獲客成本、研發費用以及營運開銷。公司在數據分析、演算法優化和市場推廣方面擁有豐富的經驗和資源，這使得其獲取和留存用戶的效率高於小型競爭對手。此外，其對基礎設施和技術的投資也受益於規模效應，能夠提供更穩定可靠的服務，形成成本上的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"As the world's largest dating app company, Match Group possesses significant advantages in economies of scale. Its vast user base allows it to spread customer acquisition costs, R&D expenses, and operational overhead. The company has extensive experience and resources in data analytics, algorithm optimization, and marketing, leading to higher efficiency in acquiring and retaining users compared to smaller competitors. Furthermore, its investments in infrastructure and technology also benefit from scale, enabling the provision of more stable and reliable services, thus forming a cost-based competitive barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Match Group 在全球範圍內運營，並針對不同地區的文化和用戶偏好進行本地化調整，這使其在特定市場建立了相對穩固的地位。然而，約會應用程式的本質是數位化服務，其核心資產（用戶數據和品牌）並非地理位置獨有。雖然在某些新興市場可能面臨較小的競爭，但其主要競爭壁壘（網絡效應和品牌）並非源於獨特的地理位置或實體資產，而是其全球化的平台和數據能力。","comment_en":"Match Group operates globally and makes localized adjustments for cultural and user preferences in different regions, establishing a relatively stable position in specific markets. However, the essence of dating apps is digital service, and their core assets (user data and brands) are not geographically unique. While it may face less competition in certain emerging markets, its primary competitive barriers (network effects and brand) do not stem from unique geographical locations or physical assets but from its globalized platform and data capabilities."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Match Group 在運營效率方面表現出色，體現在其能夠有效管理龐大的用戶群體、持續優化產品功能以及精準投放廣告。公司透過數據分析不斷提升用戶參與度和轉化率，並能靈活調整定價策略以最大化營收。其 F-Score 高達 8/9，顯示出良好的財務健康狀況和營運能力。穩定的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $1,141.5M）也證明了其營運效率和盈利能力。","comment_en":"Match Group demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, reflected in its ability to effectively manage a large user base, continuously optimize product features, and conduct precise advertising. The company constantly improves user engagement and conversion rates through data analytics and can flexibly adjust pricing strategies to maximize revenue. Its high F-Score of 8/9 indicates good financial health and operational capability. The stable free cash flow (FCF TTM: $1,141.5M) also proves its operational efficiency and profitability."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Match Group 的資本配置策略顯示出一定的審慎和效率。公司透過股票回購和偶爾的戰略性收購來增強股東價值。儘管其現金儲備相對於總負債較少，但其強勁的自由現金流使其能夠支持營運和潛在的投資。管理層在平衡有機增長和外部擴張方面展現了能力，但過去的收購整合（如對 Bumble 的潛在收購傳聞）也需謹慎評估其對長期價值的影響。","comment_en":"Match Group's capital allocation strategy shows a degree of prudence and efficiency. The company enhances shareholder value through share buybacks and occasional strategic acquisitions. Although its cash reserves are relatively small compared to total debt, its strong free cash flow enables it to support operations and potential investments. Management has demonstrated capability in balancing organic growth and external expansion, but past acquisition integrations (such as rumored potential acquisitions of Bumble) also require careful evaluation of their impact on long-term value."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Match Group 在客戶留存方面表現穩健，這得益於其強大的品牌影響力、網絡效應以及持續的產品創新。一旦用戶習慣了某個平台的介面和社交圈，且該平台能持續提供有價值的匹配機會，用戶留存率就會相對較高。然而，約會應用程式的用戶活躍度可能波動，且用戶尋求新體驗的意願也可能導致一定程度的流失。公司透過多樣化的產品線和增值服務來維持用戶黏性。","comment_en":"Match Group performs robustly in customer retention, thanks to its strong brand influence, network effects, and continuous product innovation. Once users become accustomed to a platform's interface and social circle, and the platform consistently provides valuable matching opportunities, user retention rates tend to be relatively high. However, user activity in dating apps can fluctuate, and users' desire for new experiences may also lead to some degree of churn. The company maintains user stickiness through its diverse product lines and value-added services."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Match Group 的商業模式具有一定的持久性，主要基於其在約會市場的領導地位和網絡效應。只要人們有尋找伴侶的需求，約會應用程式就會持續存在。然而，科技行業的快速變化和用戶偏好的轉移，對其長期持久性構成挑戰。新技術（如 AI 驅動的匹配）和新的社交模式可能顛覆現有格局。儘管如此，憑藉其龐大的用戶基礎和品牌組合，Match Group 在可預見的未來仍能維持其市場地位，但需要不斷適應和創新以應對潛在的顛覆。","comment_en":"Match Group's business model possesses a degree of durability, primarily based on its leadership position and network effects in the dating market. As long as people have the need to find partners, dating apps will continue to exist. However, the rapid changes in the tech industry and shifts in user preferences pose challenges to its long-term durability. New technologies (like AI-driven matching) and new social models could disrupt the existing landscape. Nevertheless, with its vast user base and brand portfolio, Match Group can maintain its market position for the foreseeable future, but it needs to continuously adapt and innovate to counter potential disruptions."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Match Group 的護城河主要建立在其強大的網絡效應和領先的品牌組合之上，這使其在約會應用程式市場佔據主導地位，形成類似於「收費橋」的商業模式，連接了龐大的用戶群體。其規模經濟和營運效率也提供了顯著的成本優勢。然而，相較於必需品行業，其品牌忠誠度和用戶轉換成本並非絕對，且行業技術變革迅速，對其長期持久性構成潛在威脅。總體而言，Match Group 擁有堅固的護城河，但需持續創新以應對競爭和用戶偏好的變化。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Match Group's moat is primarily built upon its powerful network effects and leading brand portfolio, establishing its dominance in the dating app market and creating a business model akin to a 'toll bridge' connecting a vast user base. Its economies of scale and operational efficiency also provide significant cost advantages. However, compared to essential goods industries, its brand loyalty and user switching costs are not absolute, and the industry's rapid technological changes pose potential threats to its long-term durability. Overall, Match Group possesses a solid moat but requires continuous innovation to address competition and evolving user preferences.","evidenceHash":"de6ca35ec410f6462cba278b1134fa45da62985139cf5d44d2e2a3a19cf975a4","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T12:16:29.649Z","evidenceHash":"dc9bfbeae85ff89347389cacefd2bd906639d877d865091fe8dbff054e2fac5f"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T12:16:29.649Z","evidenceHash":"dc9bfbeae85ff89347389cacefd2bd906639d877d865091fe8dbff054e2fac5f"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MTCH.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MTCH.png","website":"https://mtch.com","ceo":"Spencer Rascoff","full_time_employees":"2205","description":"Match Group, Inc. provides digital technologies in the United States and internationally. It operates through four segments: Tinder, Hinge, Evergreen and Emerging, and Match Group Asia. The company's portfolio of brands includes Tinder, Hinge, Match, Meetic, OkCupid, Pairs, Plenty Of Fish, Azar, BLK, and other brands, built to increase users' likelihood of connecting with others. It provides tailored services to meet the various preferences of its users. Match Group, Inc. was incorporated in 1986 and is based in Dallas, Texas.","description_en":"Match Group, Inc. provides digital technologies in the United States and internationally. It operates through four segments: Tinder, Hinge, Evergreen and Emerging, and Match Group Asia. The company's portfolio of brands includes Tinder, Hinge, Match, Meetic, OkCupid, Pairs, Plenty Of Fish, Azar, BLK, and other brands, built to increase users'